  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several different entities associated with the name **\"Chase Capital Services.\"** Here's an overview of the most prominent ones:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe6 1. **JPMorgan Chase \u2013 Capital & Financial Services**\nChase offers a wide range of financial services including credit cards, mortgages, commercial banking, auto loans, investing, and retirement planning. On the commercial side, they provide tailored credit, financing, treasury, and payment solutions for businesses of all sizes, with dedicated experts delivering industry-specific guidance to help manage cash flow and achieve strategic goals.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe0 2. **Chase Capital Holdings, LLC** *(Atlanta, GA \u2013 Real Estate Lending)*\nChase Capital Holdings, LLC is a family-owned and operated boutique lending business based in Atlanta, with 20+ years of expertise in the industry. Their mission is to cater to the needs of experienced real estate investors throughout the Southeastern United States, offering quick and straightforward funding solutions for residential real estate investments.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf31 3. **Chase Capital** *(Canada \u2013 Private Equity & Infrastructure)*\nChase Capital is a private capital platform dedicated to investing in, advising, and helping unique businesses grow into dynamic platforms across Canada and other regions globally. They bring valuable capital and trusted industry expertise to acquisitions and partnerships with existing owners and operators. They drive success in key growth sectors such as energy transition, waste & resource recovery infrastructure, and food & agricultural production, with a strong focus on investments and partnerships in the energy sector.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcc8 4. **Chase Capital Corporation** *(Investment Management)*\nChase Capital Corporation provides investment management services.\n\n---\n\n### \u274c 5. **Chase Capital Partners** *(Closed)*\nChase Capital Partners is permanently closed.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Chase Capital Services** you're referring to? For example:\n- Are you looking for **JPMorgan Chase's** banking/capital services?\n- A **real estate lending** company?\n- A **private equity** or **investment management** firm?\n\nThis will help me give you more precise information!",
